 "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0002": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it ", "TEXTITOPEN_0002": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-j-shriek}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 2, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:549c286ef37b2b71ba19f8267d7dd064fb2d3981609bbe52ec55d5cb410de9b2", "source_math_skeleton_hash": "sha256:d4535c38cd5bbcaddf49ad201b6232079b7e5bfbf14baa2c509ce02c6ef075bb", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:80ed68906f6c7fccab7e7f1148baa4327f118fe160fe8fb440bf66aae4e0b4f5", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a topological space.\nLet <MATH_0002> be the inclusion of an open subset.\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> Let <MATH_0003> be a presheaf of sets on <MATH_0004>. We define\nthe <TEXTITOPEN_0001>extension of <MATH_0005> by the empty set <MATH_0006><TEXTITCLOSE_0001>\nto be the presheaf of sets on <MATH_0007> defined by the rule\n<MATHSEG_0001>if<MATHSEG_0002>if<MATHSEG_0003>\nwith obvious restriction mappings.\n<STRUCT_0003> Let <MATH_0008> be a sheaf of sets on <MATH_0009>. We define\nthe <TEXTITOPEN_0002>extension of <MATH_0010> by the empty set <MATH_0011><TEXTITCLOSE_0002>\nto be the sheafification of the presheaf <MATH_0012>.\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d4fb109dcd90c379badf83a88bb908fa71221364dc5f47a9bbbd54e0de54643d", "unit_id": "tag:00A2:statement"}
